    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Philipp Henkel is a composer born in Germany studying at the University of Music Hannover with Ming Tsao, Gordon Williamson and Joachim Heintz.\r\n\r\nIn the past he has written a numerous pieces for different instrumentations. Since 2018 he has been working on his installation Panopticon surrounding the ambiguity of technology especially surveillance technology.\r\n\r\nPanopticon will make use of a newly developed A.I. based program for sound synthesis that Philipp developed for this installation.\r\n\r\nIn his master;s studies he seems to be more concerned in fluidity and viscosity in musical..."
      }
    ],
