    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Chiara Vaneigem began playing music at the age of seven and continued her studies at the Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel (2014-2018) where she worked on piano with Boyan Vodenitcharov and musical writing with Ann Kuppens. It was at the Ecole Supérieure des Arts de Mons that she obtained a master's degree in piano teaching from Hans Ryckelynck (2020) and where she is currently completing her composition studies in the classes of Claude Ledoux, Geoffrey François and Gilles Gobert. She has followed the masterclasses of composers such as Wolfgang Rihm, Stefano Proccacioli, Vincent..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
