    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Le bruit des soupirs"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/le-bruit-des-soupirs"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Video: François Doyon\r\nNarrator: Audrey Southière\r\n\r\nWhat's behind that languid sigh that rings in my ears? Small reports in the form of a soundscape that talk under a streetlight. What connects earth and sky is the extent of our anchoring that gently lifts us to our history, to our well-filled travel diaries, to the branches of our multifaceted lives and our secret gardens. Our inner silences dictate our behaviour, our thinking, sometimes loudly. Human struggles, debates, failures, slips evolve through ideas, passions, desires and beauties of the world. Exotic bird songs, nature sounds..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g10891820",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/les-oiseaux-de-nias"
