    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Recognized and appreciated by her peers, Audrée Southière is an actress whose talent goes beyond the theatre. A multidisciplinary artist, singing, dance and music are all art forms that are familiar to him. In addition to training in dramatic art, with a play profile, at the Université du Québec à Montréal, Audrée Southière has given several master classes over the years to further her interpretation.\r\n\r\nWorking in film, television and theatre, Audrée Southière also works as a host, artistic director and author. Since 2004, she has worked with many of the biggest names on the..."
      }
