    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Violist Jennifer Thiessen cultivates a particular interest in classical and contemporary chamber music, improvised music and historically inspired performance practice. From 2007 to 2012, she toured extensively with the dance company La La La Human Steps, performing music by Gavin Bryars and David Lang in the productions Amjad and New Work. In 2010, she commissioned and premiered Defòra fai sinhes lo firmament by Isaiah Ceccarelli for viola and voices. Jennifer has worked closely with such composers as Michael Matthews, Alexandra Fol, Brian Harman, Matthew Ricketts and Géraldine Eguiluz...."
      }
