        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Musician Veronika Rönkös holds a Bachelor degree in music from Bartók conservatory in Budapest and a Masters (Cum Laude) in performance and pedagogy of cello from Musical Academy of Ferenc Liszt also in Budapest. She has been established in Canada for many years and performs with many orchestras. She also has a career as a soloist, composer and an improviser.\r\n"
