  {
    "@id": "_:g12106280",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/fractions-du-silence-septieme-livre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/datePublished": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2021"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/composer": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g12106300"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Fractions du silence – Septième livre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/fractions-du-silence-septieme-livre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Je reviens, sans être sorti, du fond des terres à ces\r\n\r\nconfins, à l’heure où le jour brûle encore sur les\r\n\r\nbords, ou y fait courir un cordon de feu.\r\n\r\nAndré du Bouchet - Dans la chaleur vacante\r\n\r\n(© Mercure de France, 1961)\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nTo Chava and Daniel Boyarin\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nElaborated and almost fully composed between 1993 and 2005, FRACTIONS DU SILENCE, eight pieces – or books – cycle for different formations inspired by the poetic world of André du Bouchet, starting with a saxophone quartet (SSAT). Since the seventh book is still missing, I spontaneously thought,..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
