    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sylvain Marty studied writing at the Conservatoire de Clermont-Ferrand before studying composition for five years with F. Durieux (Cnsmdp).&nbsp;He then joined masterclasses where he was able to deepen his knowledge with teachers such as F. Bedrossian, F. Filidei, C. Czernowin, G. Aperghis, Y. Robin... He has worked with several ensembles, including the Multilatéral ensemble, the Schallfeld ensemble, the Riot ensemble, Le Balcon, L'Itinéraire, Synesthésis ensemble, Op.cit... his music has been performed at Wien modern, Afekt, Darmstadt, Gaida, Rainy days, Impuls, Festival des Musiques..."
      }
