      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Graduate of electroacoustic composition from the Conservatoire de musique de Montréal, Line Katcho works mainly in the fields of acousmatic music and audiovisual work. Her primary concerns involve using sound and image as kinetic matter, representing movement, forces or gestures. She co-founded the Soundwich concerts series for which she has ensured the artistic direction from 2013 to ’15.\r\n"
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
