        "@value": "CEM: Aléas de Cléo Palacio-Quintin | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Aléas: rediscovering the universe around us through the distorting prism of a transdisciplinary poetic narrative The CEM and Cléo Palacio-Quintin present a concert featuring the four works that the flutist-composer created with Saguenay artists during her residency at the CEM in 2020."
      }
    ],
