        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "CEM: Aléas de Cléo Palacio-Quintin"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Aléas: rediscovering the universe around us through the distorting prism of a transdisciplinary poetic narrative\r\n&nbsp;\r\nThe CEM and Cléo Palacio-Quintin present a concert featuring the four works that the flutist-composer created with Saguenay artists during her residency at the CEM in 2020.\r\n"
      }
    ],
