        "@value": "Marengère"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Véro Marengère is an emerging audiovisual artist and researcher based in Montreal. She creates artworks that evoke neoanimism, storytelling, ecosophy and digital intimacy. Inspired by everyday objects, technological communities, ASMR, electromagnetism and human voice, her work takes a critical yet very playful approach to video and music making.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nVéro Marengère is currently a graduate student in the digital music program at the Faculty of music of the Université de Montréal, where she is studying with Myriam Boucher creating a hydrofeminist and haptic framework for video..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
