        "@value": "Anne-F Jacques is interested in amplification, erratic devices and construction of various contraptions and idiosyncratic systems. That sometimes generates performances, installations, soundtracks for animation films, sometimes nothing. The use of low technology, trivial objects and rough sounds is particularly appreciated.\r\n"
