    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Léa Boudreau is a composer and musician based in Montréal. She has nourished a passionate relationship with sound since her teenage years, a time when she would spend days on end as a hermit, listening and creating… oh, how little things have changed! Nowadays, she continues to create in the realms of performance and composition, driven by a desire to explore the infinite sonic possibilities of everyday objects and to express the multitude of musical ideas keeping her awake at night.\r\n\r\nShe has received several awards in recent years: the 2nd prize in JTTP 2020 from the Canadian..."
      }
