    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Comprising 57 members and organisations, LE VIVIER is a community initiative. Its mission is to facilitate the development of new music, and offering through presentation of quality works, an open door to culture.\r\n\r\nDISSEMINATION\r\nLe Vivier’s top mandate is to produce and circulate new music. Le Vivier favours creativity, research, and innovation in terms of local, national, or international repertoire. Each season, Le Vivier programs a selection of concerts showcasing the richness and effervescence of our creators.\r\n\r\nADVOCACY\r\nBeyond its programming, Le Vivier is also a unique meeting..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
