    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Adrian Foster is an organist, composer, and teacher based in Montréal, Québec. He is the co-founder and co-artistic director of Earth World Collaborative, a creative force generating new works of music, art, film, and literature through collaboration. As a soloist and collaborative organist, Adrian is dedicated to promoting and interpreting new music, and his oncert appearances include performances with the Société de musique contemporaine du Québec, Analog Arts, the Orchestre symphonique de Montréal, and the Canadian International Organ Competition. Adrian has been involved in a wide..."
      }
