    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Maxime Corbeil-Perron is a Montréal-based composer, director and audiovisual performance artist whose work has been highlighted by numerous international competitions, media and festivals. His artistic practice has evolved in various forms: music, cinema, audiovisual performance, video art, interactive art, electroacoustic music, electronic and mixed-media music, light and sound performance.\r\n\r\nHis work has been presented in more than a hundred international events and festivals, including: L.E.V. (ES), Intonal (SE), Festival du nouveau cinéma (CA), Seeing Sound (UK), WNDX (CA), Mutek..."
      }
    ],
