      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Errance nostalgique dans la chute is an encounter between the wandering, the nostalgia and the fall. These ideas are a common thread through-out my body of work. I consider this piece a synthesis of my previous pieces. The amplification is used to reveal the intimacy of the performance.\r\n"
      }
    ],
