        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Consequential"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/consequential"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The consequence of the effect is the effect of the consequence.\r\nTime shapes perspective and perspective shapes time.\r\n&nbsp;\r\nConsequential is a 2 channels electroacoustic composition that was composed in the winter of 2021. The piece explores concepts of organicity, provenance, audio quality and consequence. Sound quality of each sound (Bit Depth and Sample Rate) was carefully decided to venture upon different spectral characteristics and dynamic ranges, how the overall \"quality\" of a recorded sound shapes its timbre, its possible transformations and manipulations, and the way it is being..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
  {
