        "@value": "Tommy Davis regularly performs all six members of the saxophone family in collaboration with other musicians, composers and dancers. In his projects, he uses and integrates electronics, movement, improvisation, spatialization and video to emphasize and explore specific musical elements that provide a deeper experience for the audience. He is a founding member of the Proteus Saxophone Quartet and the Duo d'entre-deux, who are currently active in North America and Europe as concert artists, collaborators and commissioners. In Montreal, Tommy is a saxophonist with Ensemble AKA and Ensemble..."
