    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Corie Rose Soumah is a composer born in Montreal and currently based in New York City.\r\n\r\nHer works have been performed in Canada, the U.S, the Netherlands, Germany and Italy. Her musical interests lie in shattered sounds realms through collage and gestural practices. She explores sonic textures through acoustic mediums and electronic and analog technologies. Her approach is part of an active redefinition of a new québécitude brought under the influence of cultural, sonic and aesthetic multiplicities.\r\n\r\nWinner of a SOCAN Foundation Award, Soumah works have been performed by an extensive..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Person"
    ]
  },
