    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "François Couvreur is a Belgian composer, guitarist and improviser who graduated from the Liège Conservatory of Music.\r\nThe winner of the Ça Balance Classique composition competition in 2017, Henri Pousseur Prize in 2017/2018, André Souris Prize in 2019, New music generation in 2020, his works are in particular programmed in festivals such as Ars Musica (Brussels), Loop (Brussels), Images Sonores (Liège) and are performed at the Théâtre de Liège, in Zagreb and Split (Croatia), in Montreal and Quebec City, in Maastricht and Utrecht (the Netherlands), in Kiev (Ukraine).\r\nHis music is..."
      }
    ],
