    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The second part of the Résonance croisée event offers eight concerts featuring some of the biggest international names in new music: L'arsenale Ensemble, under the direction of Filippo Perocco (Italy), percussionist Philippe Spiesser (Switzerland/France), cellist and composer Séverine Ballon (France), Duo Doblinger/Neyrinck (Austria), artists Hauptmeier-Recker and the ensembles Urwerk and Flex (Germany), as well as Quatuor Bozzini, Quasar - saxophone quartet and Nouvel Ensemble Moderne (Quebec).\r\n"
      }
    ],
