        "@value": "The Ventapane duo (Martin Karlicek on piano and Mana Shiraishi on violin) and mezzo-soprano Marie-Annick Béliveau present works from Japan and Canada, including a song cycle by composer Elliot Weingerber inspired by the poems of English writer Thomas Hardy."
