      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Based in Montréal, Alexandra Tibbitts is a harpist, improviser, composer, collaborative artist, innovator and arts organizer. &nbsp;Her solo project, The Bionic Harpist, demonstrates her accomplishments in augmented instrument practices. &nbsp;Using her harp as an instrument and digital mixer, her compositions create immersive landscapes and moving performances that are truly unique and unconventional. &nbsp;\r\n&nbsp;\r\nTibbitts actively promotes and premieres repertoire for harp and mixed music in Canada and abroad. &nbsp;Her work and compositions have been featured by the National Arts..."
      }
    ],
