    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Lascaux Expérience is a true net inside the net of the 24+1 composition-cycle: Urbana. The project has its origins in 1997.\r\n\r\nThe considerable research, which was left aside during the composition that gives the name to the cycle, Urbana (for acordeon, percussion and live dispositive, commissioned by IRCAM), constitute the sound base material for Lascaux Urbana. This material is the trace, the footprint, fixed in the multicanal audio medium of the fleeting of the elements in Urbana. This “fixed” composition was initially thought as a free access plastic installation.\r\n\r\nThe following..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:g12858340",
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/rastros"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/datePublished": [
