        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2022"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/composer": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g12858360"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rastros"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/identifier": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://levivier.ca/en/le-vivier/repertoire/rastros"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "« Trail » (2021/2022)\r\n\r\nFor flute (also bass flute), Bb clarinet (also bass clarinet), violin, 2 celli, 2 percussions &amp; piano.\r\n\r\nThe traces left by objects, thoughts and experiences are sometimes visible but, by their very nature, are manifested by absence. The absence of \"something\" that has happened.\r\nAt the same time, going through them and revealing them in sound, phrasing, texture and material, entails the production of a new trace, one that shall remain in the listener's memory. From this point of view, the work is an intermediary, a link in the transmission that carries..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
