    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A versatile musician, Victor Alibert became interested very early on in the practice of classical music as well as traditional music. Playing from Eb to bass clarinet, he can be heard in symphonic concerts (Orchestre de l'Agora); in Eastern European music (Magillah); in contemporary chamber music with Ensemble Paramirabo, or with artists such as Philippe Brach, Guillaume Arseneau, Plants and Animals. Having at heart mutual help and sharing, Victor collaborates with the Porteurs de musique during musical animations in residential centres, hospitals, psychiatric institutes and militates for..."
      }
