    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“We Are For A While” is a quietly moving ode to recycling and to the potential hiding within broken and discarded everyday objects. With Vitalija Glovackyte (objects, lighting and electronics), Lori Freedman and Michael Cutting, Architek Percussion uses homemade instruments constructed out of junk salvaged from skips, waste bins, and recycling centres."
      }
    ],
