    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Born &nbsp;in &nbsp;1962, &nbsp;he &nbsp;studied &nbsp;with &nbsp;Klaus &nbsp;Huber, &nbsp;Emanuel &nbsp;Nunes &nbsp;and &nbsp;Mathias Spahlinger &nbsp;and &nbsp;musical &nbsp;analysis &nbsp;with &nbsp;Peter &nbsp;Förtig. &nbsp;He &nbsp;also &nbsp;attended conducting &nbsp;courses &nbsp;with &nbsp;Peter Eötvös. Johannes &nbsp;Schöllhorns &nbsp;music &nbsp;has &nbsp;a &nbsp;wide &nbsp;range &nbsp;of &nbsp;genres &nbsp;from &nbsp;chamber &nbsp;music, vocal &nbsp;music &nbsp;and &nbsp;orchestra &nbsp;music &nbsp;to &nbsp;music &nbsp;for &nbsp;theatre. &nbsp;Besides &nbsp;his &nbsp;own..."
      }
