    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Gordon Williamson (b. 1974, Ottawa) is a Canadian composer currently based in Hannover, Germany. Recent activities include commissions and performances by the China National Symphony Orchestra, the Sonar Quartet, Flex Ensemble, the Radio Symphony Orchestra Stuttgart, hand werk, Ensemble Schallfeld, Asian Art Ensemble and the Swedish Radio Choir, as well as artist residencies at Künstlerhof Schreyahn and Schloss Wiepersdorf in Germany, the Styria Artist-in-Residence Program (Graz), Centre Récollets (Paris) and Casa Baldi in Italy.&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe recipient of several awards and prizes for his..."
      }
