    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Exploratory was commissioned by the Ensemble Phoenix, in Basel, and composed by Phill Niblock\r\nit was premiered in basel in June 2019, by the ensemble.\r\n\r\nExploratory - Siren Organ Version is a new version of the piece made from 300 different recordings of heavy truck sirens.&nbsp;\r\n"
      }
