      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Don't miss the Montreal visit of Québec Musiques Parallèles for a dazzling evening of music (at Le Vivier) with the Quatuor Bozzini string quartet and the electric guitar and electronics duo Moor-Kyriakides! A unique encounter between artists from here and abroad."
      }
