    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Québec Musiques Parallèles 2022 - 2e édition!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>L’événement ambulant de musiques exploratoires et d’art sonore reprend la route! E27 musiques nouvelles, Gueze-Paquet, GGRIL, No Hay Banda, Anne F Jacques, Alex Tibbitts, Still : Yves Charuest, Eyevin Nonet, Allochtone, Andy Moor- Yannis Kyriakides, Nous perçons les oreilles, Quatuor Bozzini (Clemens Merkel, violon; Alissa Cheung, violon; Stéphanie Bozzini, alto; Isabelle Bozzini, violoncelle), Ida Toninato - Pierre Luc Lecours, Violeta Garcia - Émilie Girard Charest Vidéo: Xavier Sénéchal - Studio Urubu Suivez-nous et inscrivez-vous à notre infolettre pour plus de contenu : Follow us and sign up for our newsletter for more content: Infolettre / newsletter : <a dir=\"auto\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkZMLUJFbzB1YThtZEl5c2NmeEt1djZuR3hZUXxBQ3Jtc0tuSnZaNFBWLTJjQWFsejRjT1N6UlNTWS1yeEo0TngzYm1LcERGNTRTNEJoRTlhLUVORG9Qb3F3N3RTYmhoQWZjdTdJN0NIdzNWUFVrTjdCdTV3S1lZNFdqNDBldFUxY1NUbUpmdlFRY3NBSHFTTHNTbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fquatuorbozzini.ca%2Ffr%2Fapropos%2Fliste%2F&amp;v=LT5aqMZTKJQ\">https://quatuorbozzini.ca/fr/apropos/...</a> Facebook : <a dir=\"auto\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbC1aSGxad1FJV3lNa2RGZlAyYWdJNUdpeUxhQXxBQ3Jtc0tuSFpEZWJrNWRrVmQ3QUFSTkVwRjVxXzJhcW1NakpGV1Q3Y0g0c2tqWTlMaVFaNWhFVUdJM0I1WE1tVlJLRTBoYXJZei1HZWU2cmJ6dnNIUW5CVXlLRWNFYnIyTzVOOXRBUHlfWXRIVVVWU1cwNmdnWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fquatuorbozzini%2F&amp;v=LT5aqMZTKJQ\">https://www.facebook.com/quatuorbozzini/</a> Instagram: <a dir=\"auto\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbG02NEJQLVMzcDhYTEg5RnBuV3NWRkRudHgtd3xBQ3Jtc0trbzRlOU14dVFCMXlLWWdudnJhSWV2QlJNQUo3RlVVWlpfZVAzMFRBOUtya0JIeTdhZ0Nzdy1jak1IOTQ0ZGtzclNvN0Q0eWR1MWpJZ3FzMVpVYkRHMVNOdEZuTmFKNVVaZHVWSERvV1BRUThxcHowbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fquatuorbozzini%2F&amp;v=LT5aqMZTKJQ\">https://www.instagram.com/quatuorbozz...</a> Twitter : <a dir=\"auto\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXNGTnZZWnpXT0x2T1FYTVN1emFVSGtXekk1Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsRFZ1WmtvdTB3OFVYaEF1ZW1Icl9jUWp5LS16Y3k4WHpSNFBIaXNjNlFZMzNRaHpKY1JNNlI0cnhRb2RSQmRoRWhmY2dkMnN4MkJzT0MyYW9rbzlwR0JfcjRYaTZRZUx2YXZPSTdmVGVpdFFKMk5USQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2FQuatuorBozzini&amp;v=LT5aqMZTKJQ\">https://twitter.com/QuatuorBozzini</a></p>\r\n"
