        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SCOTT THOMSON : ARBORIENTATION | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Montreal botanical Garden will open its doors to the sixteen musicians of the SuperMusique ensemble to perform Scott Thomson's site-specific work Arborientation. Following a cartographic score, each performer will offer a solo inspired by the specific essence of a tree. An enchanting 1.8 km and 85 minute interlude for both tree and music lovers."
      }
    ],
