    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Four in one - the Quatuor Bozzini is a single instrument that vibrates, breathes, and deploys a sound palette sometimes similar to that of an immense accordion, and which is sure to leave its mark on the imagination. For this particular program, three works are proposed that explore the liminal potential of sound."
      }
