        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "INTERNATIONAL COLLABORATION PROJECT FOR EMERGING ARTISTS FROM MONTREAL AND KYIV This concert will feature four new works for electroacoustic and instrumental music resulting from a cross-collaboration between musicians from the Vivier InterUniversitaire (Montreal) and the National Academy of Music of Ukraine (Kyiv)."
