    "http://schema.org/abstract": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A series of interactive and mesmerizing sonic and visual realms\r\n\r\nAlt-Escape is a one-hour digital performance that immerses the spectator in a series of interactive and mesmerizing sonic and visual realms, delving into concepts of gravity, physics, and time.\r\nThis show harnesses digital technologies to invent interactive instruments from scratch, delivering a distinct aesthetic proposition that seamlessly integrates in real-time music, video projection, and technology, breathing life into a novel concert experience.\r\nIn addition to the stage version, the group is expanding the concept of..."
      }
    ],
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/MusicComposition"
    ]
  },
