        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "VIVIER MIX / SOIRÉE-BÉNÉFICE | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "On December 5th, Le Vivier invites you to a festive and creative benefit evening. You'll have the opportunity to experience an inspiring artistic experience, while contributing to the development of Montreal's new music community. Join us for a moment of creativity alongside artists and other music enthusiasts! No experience necessary, this participatory workshop will allow you to discover the process of creating a musical work.This event will fund two projects:Creation Fund for Members: Promote creation through support for commissioned works and increased artist fees.Support Fund for Emerging Artists: Encourage the next generation by supporting creation residencies for the Pôle Relève and the annual Vivier interuniversity concert."
      }
    ],
