        "@value": "Totem contemporain & Paramirabo @CIRMMT | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An unprecedented meeting between the Babel Table of Totem Contemporain and the Paramirabo ensemble.For several years, Jean-François Laporte and Jeffrey Stonehouse have envisioned this encounter. The project is finally coming to fruition: the sounds of Paramirabo and those of Totem Contemporain's invented instruments meet through works commissioned from composers Julie Delisle, Geneviève Ackerman, Corie Rose-Soumah, Zosha Di Castri, and Katherine Young."
      }
    ],
