        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Moulin à Musique: Tableaux Musique | Le Vivier"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\"Tableaux Musique\" opens a door for children from 2 to 5 years old to a world of imagination and music. It's an exciting voyage presented through captivating sounds and visuals.A small puppet theatre brings the puppets' adventures to life, animated by two musicians. Through diverse settings like a warm sandy beach, underwater worlds, a tropical forest, or snowy landscapes, young children navigate between dreams and reality. In their own way, the children journey through the characters' adventures and memories. Armed with a variety of instruments, paintings, and objects, the artists construct and deconstruct each sonic and visual backdrop right before the little ones' eyes."
      }
    ],
