      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A sonic overdose of distortion, psychedelia, and raw electricity. Professor Bad Trip is Fausto Romitelli’s cult masterpiece, part hallucination, part manifesto. Fusing spectralism with the chaos of rock, Romitelli crafts a world where delicate melodies melt into noise, time contracts, and sound mutates. Inspired by mescaline visions and digital overload, this is music that doesn’t evolve, it implodes.Brace yourself for a wild ride through glitchy beauty and glorious disintegration. This is the sound of a bad trip you won’t want to miss."
      }
    ],
